# 默认：文本文件，由 Git 自动规范化
* text=auto

# --- Go 源码与工程文件：强制 LF（跨平台构建一致性） ---
*.go        text diff=golang
go.mod      text
go.sum      text
Makefile    text eol=lf
*.mk        text eol=lf

# --- 配置与文档：LF ---
*.yaml      text
*.yml       text
*.json      text
*.md        text
*.txt       text

# --- systemd / shell 脚本：LF（部署到 Linux，CRLF 会导致解析失败） ---
*.service   text eol=lf
*.sh        text eol=lf

# --- Windows 专属：CRLF ---
*.bat       text eol=crlf
*.cmd       text eol=crlf
*.ps1       text eol=crlf

# --- Windows 注册表导出等（如有） ---
*.reg       text eol=crlf

# --- 二进制文件：不做任何转换 ---
*.png       binary
*.jpg       binary
*.gif       binary
*.ico       binary
*.zip       binary
*.gz        binary
*.tar       binary
*.pdf       binary
